    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Chinese Way of Eating Wolfberries",
      "",
      "Recently, wolfberries have become popular in the West.",
      "The majority of wolfberries are grown in Ningxia in China, and are considered a health food.",
      "Eating wolfberries can make you feel happy and calm, give better support for exercise, ..",
      ".. increase sleep quality, and control your body weight.",
      "",
      "The Chinese also eat wolfberries, but it seems the Chinese way of eating them is a bit different from westerners.",
      "It is said that westerners like to eat them directly, or put a few wolfberries in their breakfast yoghurt.",
      "Chinese people seldom eat them directly, but usually use them to make tea or cook soup.",
      ""
